# Bytecode of the Python modules next to the scripts
__pycache__/

# Python environment that CondaPkg creates next to any environment loading
# PythonCall (TensND -> SymPyPythonCall): docs/, scripts/, test/. Since CondaPkg
# moved to pixi, the .gitignore it writes there no longer hides pixi.toml,
# pixi.lock and its own files.
.CondaPkg/
